# Bob-omb Battlefield: run at the first Goomba and jump onto it (Mario stomps
# it and bounces). The jump window is about 4 game frames wide, so if the
# demo's frame rate changes, this route can miss: demo-check then fails
# ("expected 'stomp'") and the jump frame needs re-tuning (sweep the A line).
140 170 >
170 300 ^
300 302 ^>
302 600 ^
436 442 A
